---
description: Set which desktop's mic pi-dictate captures (alt+m in pi)
argument-hint: "[dagon|nyarlothotep]"
---
Set the dictation host to `${1:-nyarlothotep}`. Run this exact command via the bash tool:

```sh
mkdir -p ~/.config/dictate && printf '%s\n' "${1:-nyarlothotep}" > ~/.config/dictate/host && cat ~/.config/dictate/host
```

Then reply with one line confirming the host. The choice persists in `~/.config/dictate/host` until changed again; pi-dictate (alt+m) will capture that desktop's microphone.